{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e1a9c4d2-6b7f-4c3a-9f10-2d8e5b7a4c61",
    "name": "TC3 - History Service (GraphQL + JWT) - Completa",
    "description": "Testa todas as operacoes GraphQL do history-service e as regras de autorizacao por role.\n\nComo usar:\n1. Suba os servicos: `docker compose up --build auth-service history-service` (auth em :8080, history em :8083).\n2. Rode a pasta '0 - Tokens JWT' inteira uma vez (Runner ou uma a uma). Ela grava doctorToken / nurseToken / patientToken nas variaveis da collection.\n3. Rode a pasta '1 - Enfermeiro (NURSE)' > 'Criar prontuario (happy path)' para semear um registro; ela grava o schedulingId usado.\n4. Rode as demais pastas na ordem.\n\nEndpoint GraphQL: {{baseUrl}}/graphql | GraphiQL: {{baseUrl}}/graphiql\n\nRegras exercitadas:\n- create: somente NURSE\n- update / delete: somente DOCTOR (chaveados por schedulingId)\n- getAll / getBySchedulingId / getByPatientId / getByDoctorId: DOCTOR ou NURSE\n- myHistory: somente PATIENT, e retorna apenas os registros do proprio paciente (patientId = subject do JWT)\n- 1 agendamento -> no maximo 1 historico (schedulingId unico)\n- campos obrigatorios: schedulingId, patientId, doctorId, date (ISO-8601), medicalRecords (nao-branco)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {"key": "authBaseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8083", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "schedulingId", "value": "9001", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "patientId", "value": "3", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "doctorId", "value": "1", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "doctorToken", "value": "", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "nurseToken", "value": "", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "patientToken", "value": "", "type": "string"},
    {"key": "nowIso", "value": "", "type": "string"}
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// data/hora local ISO-8601 sem timezone, formato aceito por LocalDateTime.parse",
          "const d = new Date();",
          "const pad = n => String(n).padStart(2, '0');",
          "const iso = `${d.getFullYear()}-${pad(d.getMonth()+1)}-${pad(d.getDate())}T${pad(d.getHours())}:${pad(d.getMinutes())}:${pad(d.getSeconds())}`;",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('nowIso', iso);"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 - Tokens JWT",
      "description": "Emite os tokens via auth-service (Basic Auth). Rode os 3 antes de qualquer outra pasta.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Token - Medico (dr.silva)",
          "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "const body = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.test('Retorna JWT Bearer', () => { pm.expect(body.tokenType).to.eql('Bearer'); pm.expect(body.accessToken).to.be.a('string'); });",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('doctorToken', body.accessToken);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "auth": {"type": "basic", "basic": [{"key": "username", "value": "dr.silva", "type": "string"}, {"key": "password", "value": "doctor123", "type": "string"}]},
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{authBaseUrl}}/auth/token"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Token - Enfermeiro (nurse.souza)",
          "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
